sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cron as ⏰ Scheduler
    participant LE as 🔍 Lead Engine
    participant Q as 📦 Job Queue
    participant DB as 🗄️ Supabase
    participant OR as 📬 Outreach
    participant MK as 👤 Minjoon
    participant BIZ as 🏪 Owner
    participant ST as 💳 Stripe
    participant DEL as ⚙️ Delivery
    participant AI as 🤖 Claude
    participant SOC as 📱 Meta/TikTok/GBP
    participant OBS as 🔔 Sentry/Alerts

    rect rgb(238,243,236)
    Note over Cron,DB: PHASE 1 — ACQUISITION
    Cron->>LE: weekly trigger
    LE->>LE: fetch Places+Yelp · rate-limited
    LE->>LE: dedupe fingerprint · audit gaps · score
    LE->>DB: upsert leads · idempotency key
    LE--xOBS: on failure → alert + retry via DLQ
    end

    rect rgb(251,238,237)
    Note over DB,OR: COMPLIANCE GATE
    DB->>OR: hot lead event (score ≥ 75)
    OR->>DB: check suppression_list + DNC + existing client
    alt blocked
        OR->>DB: mark suppressed · stop
    else clear
        OR->>Q: enqueue audit-PDF render
    end
    end

    rect rgb(253,246,227)
    Note over Q,BIZ: PHASE 2 — OUTREACH
    Q->>OR: render job
    OR->>BIZ: email 1 · audit PDF · unsubscribe link
    BIZ-->>OR: open/click webhooks → status update
    OR->>BIZ: emails 2–3 · spaced 4d
    alt unsubscribes
        BIZ->>OR: 1-click unsubscribe
        OR->>DB: suppression_list forever
    else books call
        BIZ->>MK: Cal.com booking
        MK->>BIZ: 15-min honest call
    end
    end

    alt WON
        rect rgb(238,243,236)
        Note over BIZ,DEL: PHASE 3 — ONBOARD
        BIZ->>ST: Checkout · Presence 450/mo
        ST->>DB: webhook · signature verified
        alt payment fails later
            ST->>DB: dunning webhook
            DB->>BIZ: retry emails · pause delivery day 14
        end
        DB->>DEL: kickoff project
        DEL->>SOC: OAuth connect accounts → tokens to vault
        end

        rect rgb(243,238,247)
        Note over DEL,SOC: PHASE 4 — MONTHLY DELIVERY LOOP
        loop every month
            DEL->>AI: calendar slots + brand voice profile
            AI-->>DEL: 12–20 drafts
            DEL->>MK: approval queue
            MK-->>DEL: approve / edit
            DEL->>SOC: publish · retry w/ backoff
            alt token expired
                DEL->>SOC: refresh OAuth token from vault
                DEL->>SOC: retry publish
            end
            SOC-->>DB: post IDs · reach · followers
            DEL->>BIZ: Twilio review-request SMS
        end
        end

        rect rgb(238,243,236)
        Note over DB,BIZ: PHASE 5 — REPORT & RENEW
        Cron->>DEL: monthly report job
        DEL->>DB: collect GA4 · GBP · social · ranks
        DEL->>AI: metrics → plain-English summary
        AI-->>DEL: owner-readable wins
        DEL->>BIZ: branded PDF · renewal touchpoint
        BIZ->>ST: renews 🔁
        end
    else LOST
        OR->>DB: status lost · re-nurture in 90d
        Cron->>OR: 90d later → fresh audit → sequence restarts
    end
